  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Community resilience to food insecurity &amp; emergency preparedness</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is design in close consultation with key stakeholders within the Masugbala and Gbinleh Dixing chiefdom. Findings where that these communities are underserved and the issues arose where poor access to clean and safe drinking water poor hygiene condition, food and livelihood security, access to land and women and youth participation and inclusion in governance issues.
KADDRO will work through appropriate line ministries and other organisation within the chiefdom to increase community resilience to food insecurity and natural disasters through sustainable livelihood support as one of the implementing partners of CAFOD within the Kambia District</narrative>
  </description>
